  "implementation": [
    "Typed observer phase negotiated through v6 attach capability 0x40; link capability 0x80 stays independent and legacy attention bytes are unchanged.",
    "Bounded two-stage desktop fallback preserves mode, fingerprint and identity; an intermediate service retains link support.",
    "Shared CLI catalog owns discovery, labels, launch/model/resume arguments and adapter selection while preserving persisted IDs.",
    "Restore saves the complete restart plan before constructing create-mode connections.",
    "Cancelable descriptor tickets serialize final commit per endpoint in one process; replaced connections cannot overwrite a newer identity.",
    "Header forward declarations, direct includes and explicit Qt moc inclusion preserve concrete consumers.",
    "Consolidates terminal hyperlink, smaller default font and direct size controls from terminal-usability.json."
  ],
